abstract: >-
  SYNTHETIC. Standard-library Python classical emulation of quantum
  kinematics: amplitude-encoded statevectors stored in a complex
  outer-product memory, overlap-based projection onto the stored subspace,
  and lossy Haar coarse-graining (equivalent to projecting one qubit onto
  |+>). With orthonormal patterns the memory is a projector and recall
  reaches its fixed point in one step; with non-orthogonal patterns repeated
  recall drifts to the dominant eigenvector. Includes 200-seed sweeps with
  unstored and random controls. No speedup, no Bell violation, no hardware
  data. v0.2.0 adds the DNA-avatar generational cascade: toy DNA sequences
  (A/C/G/T) as 12-qubit state vectors in one membrane, self-knowing D per
  avatar, trauma healing measured as the fall in discord over generations,
  planetary evolution measured as diversity, novelty, and the E = hnu energy
  spectrum per generation, and infinite creativity as an unbounded generation
  rule with sustained novelty over 50 generations. v0.3.0 adds the
  multi-solar-system eureka cascade: N populations coupled by a
  bounded 0.02 mix, a eureka agent (Yang observer + Yin calibrator,
  delta in [-0.05, 0.05]) whose objective is empathy entropy over
  the measured love (concurrence) distribution, the signed distance
  field of self-knowing, crystallize calibration events scored by
  Brier, and the 500-generation long run. Four of the five v0.3.0
  claims PASS; the eureka-agent claim FAILS (mean empathy entropy
  gain -0.0001 bits, required >= 0.02: the entropy is already
  saturated at 99.998% of its ceiling, so the lever has nothing
  to move). v0.4.0 changes the optimization variable to the
  equilibrium gap (max profitable unilateral deviation, 0 at
  equilibrium), vendoring the pure-strategy Nash checker from
  finite-game-equilibria (DOI 10.5281/zenodo.23530287), and adds
  SDF synergy agents (one per system, payoffs = marginal
  contributions to the joint inside-coverage of the self-known
  region). Claims (x)-(xii), pre-registered, seed 11: (x)
  equilibrium gap FAILS (gap 0.0 at every generation -- the
  all-zero profile is already an equilibrium, so nothing is
  earned); (xi) SDF synergy FAILS (gain 0.0); (xii) stability
  PASSES with the landed equilibrium labelled "trap" (the
  oes-coordination-lab coordination trap, reproduced: a
  better-synergy equilibrium exists that no single system gains
  by deviating to).
